#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/title_block_project_collection.rst:5
msgid "Title block project collection"
msgstr "图框项目集合"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/title_block_project_collection.rst:7
msgid ""
"The project collection is the only `collection`_ which is not part from the "
"software structure. A project collection is a `title block collection`_ that"
" is part of the project file, each `project`_ has its own `title block "
"collection`_."
msgstr ""
"项目集合是唯一不属于软件结构的 `集合 <collection_>`_ 。项目集合是 `图框集合 <title block collection_>`_"
" 的一种，它属于项目文件的一部分，每个 `项目 <project_>`_ 都有自己的 `图框集合 <title block collection_>`_"
" 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/title_block_project_collection.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech project tree"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目树"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/title_block_project_collection.rst:16
msgid ""
"QElectroTech does not allow working on this `collection`_, the user cannot "
"add or delete any `title block`_ manually. The user can only edit `title "
"blocks`_ used in the project without modifying the original `title block`_ "
"from `QET`_ or `User`_ collection."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 不允许在此 `集合 <collection_>`_ 上进行操作，用户无法手动添加或删除任何 `图框 <title "
"block_>`_ 。用户只能编辑项目中使用的 `图框 <title blocks_>`_ ，而不会修改 `QET <QET_>`_ 或 `用户 "
"<User_>`_ 集合中的原始 `图框 <title block_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/title_block_project_collection.rst:20
msgid ""
"The `title block`_ is copied from `QET`_ or `User`_ collection automatically"
" by QElectroTech when the user introduces a new `title block`_ in one "
"`folio`_ of the `project`_. If the `title block`_ has already been used "
"previously, QElectroTech does not need to add again the `title block`_ to "
"the project collection."
msgstr ""
"当用户在 `项目 <project_>`_ 的某个 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 中引入新 `图框 <title block_>`_ "
"时，QElectroTech 会自动从 `QET <QET_>`_ 或 `用户 <User_>`_ 集合复制该 `图框 <title block_>`_"
" 。如果该 `图框 <title block_>`_ 之前已经使用过，QElectroTech 无需再次将 `图框 <title block_>`_ "
"添加到项目集合中。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/title_block_project_collection.rst:25
msgid ""
"If one `title block`_ is deleted from the `project`_, QElectroTech does not "
"delete the `title block`_ from the project collection automatically, the "
"`title block`_ is marked in red. `Cleaning the project`_ deletes all `title "
"block`_ from the project collection that are not used inside the `project`_ "
"automatically at the cleaning time."
msgstr ""
"如果从 `项目 <project_>`_ 中删除某个 `图框 <title block_>`_ ，QElectroTech 不会自动从项目集合中删除该 "
"`图框 <title block_>`_ ，该 `图框 <title block_>`_ 会被标记为红色。`清理项目 <Cleaning the "
"project_>`_ 会在清理时自动从项目集合中删除所有未在 `项目 <project_>`_ 内使用的 `图框 <title block_>`_ 。"
